                  {
                    "value": "Colour compares each material with the incumbent of its own case — green = better, white = at the incumbent, red = worse. Flag columns: 1 = yes (green), 0 = no (red for the technical gate, amber for PCF gaps).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "11px"
