                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "A blank cell means unknown, never zero: a material without a PCF has empty, uncoloured carbon cells. Quadrants of the scatter: lower-left win-win · lower-right carbon gain at a cost · upper-left cost gain at a carbon cost · upper-right worse on both. No score, no ranking — each case is its own decision.",
